# Architecture

## Layout

```
app/                   # App Router routes, layouts, page-specific UI
app/components/        # Arcade-specific sections (Header, Footer, Hero, …)
app/*/page.tsx         # Route pages (events, games, party, menu, …)
components/            # Shared shadcn-style UI primitives
lib/                   # Utilities (cn, helpers)
public/                # Static assets
docs/                  # Product specs and internal notes
netlify.toml           # Netlify build + redirects
```

## Placement

| Concern | Location |
|---------|----------|
| Global shell (header, footer, banners) | `app/layout.tsx`, `app/components/Header.tsx`, `Footer.tsx`, `LocationClosingBanner.tsx` |
| Home page sections | `app/page.tsx`, `app/components/HeroSection.tsx`, `*Section.tsx` |
| Store hours / seasonal footer callouts | `app/components/Footer.tsx` |
| Location closing / promo banner | `app/components/LocationClosingBanner.tsx` |
| Events + Facebook embeds | `app/events/page.tsx` |
| Games / pinball / redemption lists | `app/games/page.tsx` |
| Party booking marketing page | `app/party/page.tsx` |
| Contact forms (EmailJS) | `app/components/ContactSection.tsx`, env via `NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_*` |
| Theme + global styles | `app/globals.css`, `components/theme-provider.tsx`, `tailwind.config.ts` |

## Boundaries

- Prefer existing Tailwind + shadcn patterns; match neon/primary styling already in use.
- Keep `"use client"` only where needed (hooks, browser APIs, embeds).
- Image CDN URLs for game art are centralized in `app/games/page.tsx` — follow that pattern when adding listings.
- Do not add frameworks or heavy abstractions without an explicit decision.
- Party **booking system** is spec-only (`docs/party-booking-requirements.md`) — do not imply live booking unless implemented.
